    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "System Timetable\nEffective September 7, 1983\nNEW NON-STOP JET SERVICE\nSan Jose to Palm Springs and Sacramento\nModesto/Stockton to Las Vegas\nPortland to Reno\nSee what we're up to!",
      "ROLLS ROYCE POWERED\nJET SERVICE TO\n20 CITIES IN THE WEST\nVancouver\nPortland\nRedmond/Bend\nSunriver\nMedford\nKlamath Falls\nBoise\nRedding\nRenor\nSacramento\nStockton\nModesto\nSan Francisco\n• San Jose\nMonterey/Salina\nLas\nResno\nBakersfield\nSanta Barba\nPalm Springs\nLos Angeles\nPaCIFC\nPRESS\nCall Your Travel Agent",
      "FLY THE AIRLINE WITH ROLLSROYCE POWERED ONE ELEVEN\nTWIN JETS TO 20 CITIES IN THEWEST. EXTRA CARRY-ON LUGGAGE\nSPACE, BARGAIN AIR FARES,SEAT SELECTION, AND INTER-\nLINE CONNECTIONSTO THE WORLD...\nSEE WHATVE'RE UP TO!\nALL FLIGHTS PROVIDED WITH ROLLSROYCE POWERED ONE ELEVEN TWIN JETS.\nVancouver\nPortland\nRedmond/Bend\nSunriver\nMedford\nBoise\nKlamath Falls\nRedding\nChico\nReno/Lake Tahoe\nSan Francisco\nSacramento\nStockton\nModesto\nSan Jose\nMonterey/Salinas\nLas Vegas\nFresno\nBakersfield\nSanta Barbara.\nPalm Springs\nLos Angeles\nMuse Air\nAir Cal\nAmerican\nNorthwest\nKLM\nTWA\nPacific Express\nEastern\nSouthwest Airlines\nHawaii Express\nWestern\nMexicana\nInternational\nCarriers\nDelta\nContinental\nPSA\nRepublic\nFrontier\nUS Air\nPan Am\nLos Angeles\nInternational Airport\nAspen\nUnited\nTexas Intl.\nAir Canada\nAspen\nEastern\nInland Empire\nUnited\nDelta\nAmerican\nWestAir\nAirCal\nNorth Terminal\n\"See what we're up to!\"\nNEW NON-STOP JET SERVICE\nSan Jose to Palm Springs and Sacramento\nModesto/Stockton to Las Vegas\nPortland to Reno\nSan Francisco\nInternational Airport\n2\nCentral Terminal\nCP Air\nPan Am\nInternational Carriers\nRepublic\nPSA\nContinental\nAlaska\nTWA\nPacific Express\nWestern\nNorthwest\nUS Air\n3"
